# Flames for the Dead (battlefield.flames_for_the_dead#exit): inside area 1, Wind_Pillar_Exit: 32003 with update option
# 1 and finish option 0 (only the event release); triggered again, finish option 4 leaves the battlefield (0x075
# cleared); no position change in the trace. A warp to the entrance and Wind_Pillar_1 gives the menu 32000 again.
lists BearclawPinnacle/Wind_Pillar_1/onTrigger BearclawPinnacle/Wind_Pillar_Exit/onTrigger BearclawPinnacle/onEventUpdate/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventUpdate/32003 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=BearclawPinnacle pos=-720,9,-441 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop ThreePaths current
login
missionstatus Cop 8 pos=4               # a GM
trigger Wind_Pillar_1
update 32000 option=1
finish
trigger Wind_Pillar_Exit
update 32003 option=1
finish option=0
trigger Wind_Pillar_Exit
finish option=4
warp -720,9,-441 BearclawPinnacle
trigger Wind_Pillar_1
